    "fullSolution": "**Find projection of $\\mathbf{v} = \\begin{bmatrix} 3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 0 \\end{bmatrix}$ onto $\\mathbf{u} = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\end{bmatrix}$**\n\n**Formula:**\n$$\\text{proj}_{\\mathbf{u}}\\mathbf{v} = \\frac{\\mathbf{v} \\cdot \\mathbf{u}}{\\mathbf{u} \\cdot \\mathbf{u}} \\mathbf{u}$$\n\n**Compute dot products:**\n$$\\mathbf{v} \\cdot \\mathbf{u} = 3(1) + 4(1) + 0(1) = 7$$\n$$\\mathbf{u} \\cdot \\mathbf{u} = 1^2 + 1^2 + 1^2 = 3$$\n\n**Calculate projection:**\n$$\\text{proj}_{\\mathbf{u}}\\mathbf{v} = \\frac{7}{3}\\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 7/3 \\\\ 7/3 \\\\ 7/3 \\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n**Answer:** $\\displaystyle\\begin{bmatrix} 7/3 \\\\ 7/3 \\\\ 7/3 \\end{bmatrix}$ or $\\displaystyle\\frac{7}{3}\\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\end{bmatrix}$",
